 to spark connection and keep the dialogue flowing from the first pour thro
 ugh the final course.\n\nIt’s a convivial take on dinner at The ’House
 —welcoming\, engaging\, and created for those who appreciate exceptional
  food\, spirited conversation\, and even better company.\n\n*Tickets are $
 100 per person\, plus tax\, and are reserved for members only. Cancellatio
