UID:quin-event-203298@thequinhouse.com
DTSTAMP:20260928T190000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260928T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260928T203000
SUMMARY:'Quin Chat: Equity in Breast Cancer Care
LOCATION:Scottie's
DESCRIPTION:Category: Health & Wellness\nPrice: Free\nAvailability: 48 spot
 s left\nStatus: Available\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/eve
 nts/203298\n\n7:00PM Reception\, 7:30PM Discussion\n\nPresident\, CEO\, an
 d founder of Gretta Enterprises\, and breast cancer survivor\, Gretta Mona
 han joins Meredith Mendelson\, Executive Director of The Ellie Fund\; an
 d Dr. Rachel Freedman\, MD\, MPH\, medical oncologist and clinical researc
 her at Dana Farber Cancer Institute\, for a discussion informed by lived 
 experience\, patient advocacy\, emotion and practical support\, and medici
 ne. Personal\, thoughtful\, and refreshingly candid\, the conversation mo
 ves beyond awareness to consider what it really means to show up - for our
 selves\, for the people we love\, and for communities navigating breast ca
 ncer every day.\n\n*This event is complimentary and reserved for members o
 nly. Complimentary light bites and refreshments will be served. We kindly 
 ask that all cancellations be made at least 24 hours prior to the start of
  the event.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/203298
CATEGORIES:Health & Wellness
