 b before the show. Dining walk-ins are welcome.\n\n*This event is availabl
 e for members and up to one registered guest. Complimentary light bites a
 nd refreshments will be served. We kindly ask that all cancellations be ma
 de at least 24 hours prior to the start of the event.
