LOCATION:Meet in The Lobby
DESCRIPTION:Category: The Arts\nPrice: Free\nAvailability: 32 spots left\nS
 tatus: Available\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/20362
 6\n\nJoin The 'Quin’s art collection curator Kate Chertavian for an art 
 tour focused on the Core Collection. The discussion will begin in Bondo wi
 th Donald Lipski's spectacular statement chandelier and Christopher Wool's
  monumental silkscreens and will continue with a thematic exploration of w
 orks on the grand staircase. With insight into the collaborative process o
 f creating this incredible collection\, the tour will conclude in the lobb
 y with artists such as Julie Mehretu\, Andy Warhol\, Cy Twombly\, and Clau
 de Monet.\n\n*This event is complimentary and reserved for members\, plus 
 one guest. We kindly ask that all cancellations be made at least 24 hours 
 prior to the start of the event.
