DESCRIPTION:Category: Member Mixer\nPrice: $100.00 per person\nAvailability
 : 14 spots left\nStatus: Available\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhous
 e.com/events/176002\n\nJoin The ‘Quin House Managing Director\, Matthias
  Kiehm\, for an evening of meaningful connections over a thoughtfully cura
 ted three-course dinner. Enjoy expertly paired wines as you engage with fe
 llow members\, guided by conversation prompts designed to inspire deeper\,
  more memorable exchanges. This unique experience offers the perfect blend
  of great company\, engaging dialogue\, and a menu crafted to delight the 
