UID:quin-event-203636@thequinhouse.com
DTSTAMP:20261005T183000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261005T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261005T200000
SUMMARY:'Quin Chat: Latinas Leading Business
LOCATION:Scotties
DESCRIPTION:Category: ‘Quin Chat\nPrice: Free\nAvailability: 110 spots le
 ft\nStatus: futureSale\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events
 /203636\n\n6:30PM Reception\, 7:00PM Discussion\n\nIn celebration of Hisp
 anic Heritage Month\, join us for a ’Quin Chat that shines a light on th
 e growing influence of Latinas shaping America’s economic future. Drawi
 ng from a new national study focused on U.S. Latinas\, the conversation 
 will explore their expanding  economic power\, leadership\, and impact—
 and why this generation of leaders represents a force poised to shape the
  future of business and the broader U.S. economy.\n\nThe research began in
  2025\, when the Latino Donor Collaborative\, Hispanics in Philanthropy\, 
 and We Are ALX - grant recipient of The 'Quin Impact Fund - a joined force
 s to envision a national study capturing the economic contributions and po
 tential of U.S. Latinas. Moderated by Nathalie Rayes\, former U.S. Ambassa
 dor to Croatia and civic leader\, the conversation brings together three o
 f the original thought partners behind the study: Eneida Roman\, President
  and CEO of We Are ALX and a nationally recognized advocate for advancing 
 women and Latinos\; Ana Marie Argilagos\, former President & CEO of Hispan
 ics in Philanthropy\; and Ana Valdez\, President & CEO of the Latino Donor
  Collaborative. Together\, they will share the story behind the research\,
  and consider what the rising influence of Latinas means for business\, le
 adership\, and philanthropy.\n\n*This event is complimentary and reserved 
 for members only. Complimentary light bites and refreshments will be serv
 ed. We kindly ask that all cancellations be made at least 24 hours prior t
 o the start of the event.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/203636
CATEGORIES:‘Quin Chat
END:VEVENT
