 \nTime: 8 PM – 1 AM\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/
 202982\n\nSlip into the camouflage of costume for an evening under the eth
 ereal shadows of lacy silk couture…\n\nYou're cordially invited to The �
 ��Quin’s Annual Halloween Soirée an elegant and entangled ticketed affa
 ir. \n\nUnder the flicker of flame\, the ‘House will captivate with ind
 ulgent buffets\, enchanting performances\, and the deceivingly translucent
  jeweled veil - of the spider’s web.\n\nEnsnared? Fall victim.\n\nIn th
 e shadowed corners of the ‘House\, become entangled in buffets of culina
 ry bites\, live-action stations\, passed delicacies\, and venomous cocktai
 ls. A dangerous game of hide-and-seek\, spiral the Grand Staircase lured b
 y live musical performances\, shadowed portraitists\, acrobats\, and other
 -worldly talents...\n\nPerilous vibes take center stage in \n\nBondo \n\
 nwith a Headline DJ Performance from \n\n10:00PM - Midnight\n\nIn the spi
