 sively available for purchase through the Member App & Portal beginning Se
 ptember 16th at 10:00AM. Tickets for members and their guests are $295* ea
 ch. To best accommodate members' varying preferences\, we are delighted t
 o extend a limited allocation of up to 3 guest tickets per member for Frid
 ay evening's affair.\n\n*Taxes and beverages are not included in the ticke
 t price. Beverages will be available for purchase through our masterful te
 am of mixologists. \n\nAt this time\, member tickets are still available 
 for the Friday\, October 23rd party\, however guest tickets are fully com
 mitted in our best efforts to reserve as many tickets as possible for int
 erested members. Should we have the opportunity to offer an extended amoun
 t of guest tickets once all members are accounted for\, we will begin offe
 ring these to members who have submitted their names to the guest waitlist
 . Please CLICK HERE to submit a request to the Guest Ticket Waitlist. \n
 \n______________________________________________________\n\nPlease be awar
 e of these important notices:\n\nCANCELLATION POLICY\n Kindly note that ti
 ckets are non-refundable and nontransferable once assigned.\n\nENTRY\n All
  Member and guest tickets purchased\, are linked to the Member’s profile
