 embers must arrive and remain with their guest(s) at all times. Guests mus
 t be age 21+. We strongly encourage review of the Members’ Policy to ens
 ure that you and your guest(s) are aware of Club rules.\n\nVALET SERVICES\
 n Valet services will be suspended on the evenings of October 23 & 24. Ple
 ase plan ahead to secure rideshare services or park at the nearest garage 
 in Back Bay. Metered street parking is limited but also available.\n\nNO P
 HOTO POLICY\n Please be aware that we will offer a photo opportunity on th
 ese evenings\; however\, the regular Photo Policy will otherwise be in eff
 ect and enforced. Those who do not comply with the Privacy Agreement will 
