 Available\nTime: 6 PM – 11 PM\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.c
 om/events/195306\n\nIn celebration of The 'Quin's fifth anniversary\, we i
 nvite members to save the date for an extraordinary evening at MGM Music H
 all at Fenway. Bringing together the leaders\, creators\, innovators\, and
  rising stars shaping Boston's future\, the evening will feature world-cla
